              "message": "macOS: the app builds and passes clippy again after main.rs was split\n\n`cargo build -p vectorcraft` on macOS stops with nine E0433 errors:\napp.rs and host_services.rs use `mac_menu`, `mac_window`,\n`open_documents`, `gpu`, `mac_save_format`, `mac_tablet` and\n`mac_screen_color` without importing them since those items moved out\nof main.rs. The two files now import them under the same cfg as the\ncode that uses them.\n\n`cargo clippy -p vectorcraft --all-targets -- -D warnings` on macOS then\nstops at the wildcard import in clipboard.rs's macOS module, which now\nnames the two items it uses.\n\nOther platforms compile the same code as before.",
